{"audio": "romans-13.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 129333, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1867, "text": "Romans, Chapter Thirteen."}, {"start_ms": 1867, "end_ms": 5200, "text": "Let every soul be subject unto the higher powers."}, {"start_ms": 5200, "end_ms": 10667, "text": "For there is no power but of God: the powers that be are ordained of God."}, {"start_ms": 10667, "end_ms": 18800, "text": "Whosoever therefore resisteth the power, resisteth the ordinance of God: and they that resist shall receive to themselves damnation."}, {"start_ms": 18800, "end_ms": 23200, "text": "For rulers are not a terror to good works, but to the evil."}, {"start_ms": 23200, "end_ms": 26400, "text": "Wilt thou then not be afraid of the power?"}, {"start_ms": 26400, "end_ms": 32667, "text": "do that which is good, and thou shalt have praise of the same: For he is the minister of God to thee for good."}, {"start_ms": 32667, "end_ms": 43467, "text": "But if thou do that which is evil, be afraid; for he beareth not the sword in vain: for he is the minister of God, a revenger to execute wrath upon him that doeth evil."}, {"start_ms": 43467, "end_ms": 49467, "text": "Wherefore ye must needs be subject, not only for wrath, but also for conscience sake."}, {"start_ms": 49467, "end_ms": 57733, "text": "For for this cause pay ye tribute also: for they are God's ministers, attending continually upon this very thing."}, {"start_ms": 57733, "end_ms": 67733, "text": "Render therefore to all their dues: tribute to whom tribute is due; custom to whom custom; fear to whom fear; honour to whom honour."}, {"start_ms": 67733, "end_ms": 74933, "text": "Owe no man any thing, but to love one another: for he that loveth another hath fulfilled the law."}, {"start_ms": 74933, "end_ms": 92267, "text": "For this, Thou shalt not commit adultery, Thou shalt not kill, Thou shalt not steal, Thou shalt not bear false witness, Thou shalt not covet; and if there be any other commandment, it is briefly comprehended in this saying, namely, Thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself."}, {"start_ms": 92267, "end_ms": 97600, "text": "Love worketh no ill to his neighbour: therefore love is the fulfilling of the law."}, {"start_ms": 97600, "end_ms": 106133, "text": "And that, knowing the time, that now it is high time to awake out of sleep: for now is our salvation nearer than when we believed."}, {"start_ms": 106133, "end_ms": 113733, "text": "The night is far spent, the day is at hand: let us therefore cast off the works of darkness, and let us put on the armour of light."}, {"start_ms": 113733, "end_ms": 122933, "text": "Let us walk honestly, as in the day; not in rioting and drunkenness, not in chambering and wantonness, not in strife and envying."}, {"start_ms": 122933, "end_ms": 129333, "text": "But put ye on the Lord Jesus Christ, and make not provision for the flesh, to fulfil the lusts thereof."}], "words": [{"t": "Romans,", "s": 381, "e": 863, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 923, "e": 1265, "si": 0}, {"t": "Thirteen.", "s": 1305, "e": 1827, "si": 0}, {"t": "Let", "s": 2269, "e": 2429, "si": 1}, {"t": "every", "s": 2530, "e": 2730, "si": 1}, {"t": "soul", "s": 2891, "e": 3212, "si": 1}, {"t": "be", "s": 3293, "e": 3373, "si": 1}, {"t": "subject", "s": 3493, "e": 3935, "si": 1}, {"t": "unto", "s": 3995, "e": 4176, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 4216, "e": 4296, "si": 1}, {"t": "higher", "s": 4337, "e": 4618, "si": 1}, {"t": "powers.", "s": 4678, "e": 5160, "si": 1}, {"t": "For", "s": 5460, "e": 5580, "si": 2}, {"t": "there", "s": 5601, "e": 5741, "si": 2}, {"t": "is", "s": 5761, "e": 5841, "si": 2}, {"t": "no", "s": 5941, "e": 6041, "si": 2}, {"t": "power", "s": 6161, "e": 6562, "si": 2}, {"t": "but", "s": 6722, "e": 6862, "si": 2}, {"t": "of", "s": 6882, "e": 6962, "si": 2}, {"t": "God:", "s": 7022, "e": 7383, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 7944, "e": 8044, "si": 2}, {"t": "powers", "s": 8084, "e": 8484, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 8524, "e": 8664, "si": 2}, {"t": "b